+# Changelog
+
+## Unreleased
+- Block instrument change on trades that already have exits (bug 105).
+- Ignore `*.rej`/`*.orig`; removed committed `.rej` files (bug 104).
+- README: stack, deploy, tests, backup, upgrade checklist; CHANGELOG added (bug 106).
+
+## Audit round 9
+- Audit user id set inside the request transaction (31, 96).
+- FX rate frozen per exit execution, `rate_source` column, stale rates logged (72, 88, 102).
+- Alerts: `superseded` flag and re-arm after recovery (83, 87, 94, 103).
+- Postgres-only guarded test suite, compose `test` profile (90, 95, 101).
+- Lockfile + single `npm ci` in nginx image (99, 100); `price_cache` model matches DB (98).
