+# Reaper's Journal
+A centralized trading journal for disciplined forex traders: log executions, refine strategies, and monitor portfolio growth without emotion.
 
-# reapersJournal
-Reaper's Journal is a centralized financial command center for disciplined traders to log executions, refine strategies, and monitor portfolio growth without emotion.
+## Stack
+React + Vite (built and served by nginx) · FastAPI (Python 3.12) · Postgres 16 · price worker · Docker Compose. Live prices come from TwelveData (set `TWELVEDATA_API_KEY`).
 
+## Run
+```bash
+docker compose up -d --build      # app, worker, db, nginx
+```
+Migrations in `db/migrations/` are applied automatically on startup by `migrate.py` (table `schema_migrations`). Never edit a migration that has been applied; add a new one.
+
+## Deploy (Portainer)
+Stack -> **Pull and redeploy**. The nginx image builds the frontend with `npm ci`, so `frontend/package-lock.json` must be committed and up to date (run `npm install` locally after any dependency change).
+
+## Tests
+Tests run only against a throw-away Postgres database whose name ends in `_test`:
+```bash
+docker compose --profile test run --rm tests
+```
+The suite refuses to run if `TEST_DATABASE_URL` is missing or equals the live `DATABASE_URL`.
+
+## Backup / restore
+Per-user ZIP from Settings -> Backup; restore with the account password. After upgrades, take a backup first.
+
+## Upgrade checklist
+1. Backup. 2. Pull and redeploy. 3. Check `docker compose logs backend` for migration errors. 4. Open the app, check Master Log and Trades load.
+
+See `CHANGELOG.md` for what changed.
